Here's my translation for the first paragraph of uikipedias' article
on "gugde" (which currently is blank and gets redirected to "liste loi
gugde"), from the English version
(http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sovereign_state). This is pertinent to
the "gugde" discussion on the jbovlaste list.

eng -------------------------------
A sovereign state is a political association with effective internal
and external sovereignty over a geographic area and population which
is not dependant on, or subject to, the power of any other power of
state. While in abstract terms a sovereign state can exist without
being recognised by other sovereign states, unrecognised states will
often find it difficult to exercise full treaty-making powers and
engage in diplomatic relations with other sovereign states.

jbo -------------------------------
lo gugde cu jecta girzu lo ca'a ka nenri je bartu ziftru lo canlu .e
lo xabju kei poi na lacri ja rinju lo nu lo drata gugde cu vlipa .i
fau lo ku'i si'o da ka'e gugde fi'o na zanru lo drata gugde kei ta'e
nandu fa lo nu lo na'e se zanru gugde cu mulno vlipa tu'a lo
gugbinselnu'e gi'e se jansu srana lo drata gugde

